"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Hooker County shows January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years since 1951. In 2026 so far, February to March sat at 28% of normal and March to April at 30% on the middle of the grids. Back in 2025, May to June on the middle ran 150% of normal. Grid 26216 had its driest year in 1989 at 45%.</p>"}
